B.EZ=new A.lJ("EN","FAMILY CALENDAR","A FAMILY TALE","The old doctor's\nsecret","Long before this calendar existed, an old doctor welcomed newborn after newborn into the world \u2014 and once learned a strange little method for reading dates, said to whisper whether a boy or a girl was on its way.","There was no science behind it, yet he noted it down quietly for forty years. More often than not, the old method guessed right.","Nobody can explain why. This calendar simply carries his story forward \u2014 not as medicine, but as an old family game between dates and the names yet to come.","Before he hung up his coat for good, he passed the secret on to me \u2014 and today, it lives on as this very calendar.","Begin the story","Every date tells\na little story.","MOTHER","FATHER","CONCEPTION DATE","If you know the approximate date, enter it. If not, tap the button below.","Select date","Calculate","Conception date must be after both parents' birth dates, and the mother must be at least 15 years old at conception.","The calendar doesn't cover the period before the mother turned 15, or before the father was born.","Something went wrong while calculating \u2014 please try again.","Your calendar","Periods","Select date","Cancel","Confirm","Higher odds for a boy","Higher odds for a girl","Boy","Girl","Neutral","On a neutral day, the mother's and father's scores are exactly equal, so there's nothing to tip the calculation toward a boy or a girl.",A.aFC(),"SELECTED DAY'S COLOUR","Blue","Blush","Neutral","On this date, the odds tip gently toward a little boy.","On this date, the odds tip gently toward a little girl.","This date keeps its secret \u2014 the signs are evenly balanced, so either colour could arrive.","For fun only \u2014 not a medical or scientific method.","Preparing\u2026",B.Ok,B.a3,A.aFx())
